	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [{
		description: [
			"&nWelcome to Create: Forge Frontier!&r"
			""
			"Welcome to a world where engineering, exploration, and imagination come together to create an unforgettable adventure."
			""
			"&6Create: Forge Frontier&r transforms Minecraft into a journey driven by innovation, rewarding curiosity and creativity at every turn. From humble beginnings in the Overworld to the farthest reaches of space, every machine you build and every world you explore contributes to an adventure unlike any other."
			""
			"Your story begins with a single machine."
			""
			"Where it ends is entirely up to you."
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			""
			"&lEngineering Tomorrow&r"
			""
			"At the heart of Forge Frontier lies the &3Create&r mod, the foundation upon which your entire factory will be built."
			""
			"Master gears, shafts, belts, rotational power, and countless mechanical systems as you transform raw resources into sprawling automated production lines. Every contraption you design becomes another step toward constructing powerful rockets, conquering distant planets, and ultimately forging humanity's future among the stars."
			""
			"Every factory tells the story of its engineer."
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			""
			"&lA Carefully Crafted Adventure&r"
			""
			"Every aspect of &6Create: Forge Frontier&r has been carefully redesigned to create a seamless progression experience."
			""
			"Recipes have been rebalanced, technologies have been integrated, and dimensions have been woven together into a single cohesive adventure. Rather than rushing from one mod to the next, you'll gradually master each system as it naturally becomes part of your growing industrial empire."
			""
			"Every milestone has a purpose."
			""
			"Every challenge prepares you for the next."
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			""
			"&lA Living Project&r"
			""
			"Forge Frontier continues to grow with every update."
			""
			"New quests, structures, progression improvements, quality-of-life features, and entirely new adventures are continually being added as development continues. Your feedback, bug reports, and suggestions help shape the future of the pack, making every release better than the last."
			""
			"Together, we're building something extraordinary."
			""
			"If you ever need assistance—or simply want to share your creations—join our community on &1Discord&r by clicking the image below this quest!"
			""
			"{@pagebreak}"
			""
			"&lMeet the Forge Frontier Development Team&r"
			""
			"Behind every machine, quest, and world is a passionate team dedicated to creating the best experience possible."
			""
			"- &eM0nkeyPr0grammer&r — &lLead Developer and Project Director&r"
			"- &eGamma02&r — &lFeature Engineer and Systems Integrator&r"
			"- &eThunderkeeper&r — &lQuest Architect and Wiki Specialist&r"
			"- &eCtrlAltDyleted&r — &lFormer Quest Architect&r"
			"- &eSSZNBEATS&r — &lMusic Composer and Soundtrack Producer&r"
			""
			"Together, we're building a frontier where creativity, automation, and exploration know no limits."
			""
			"Thank you for being part of the journey."
			""
			"Now..."
			""
			"Go forge your frontier."
		]
